                    %mi C
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi ω
                        %mi op
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P_{small}: C^{\omega^{op}} \to C^{\omega^{op}}
            on the category of forests, and analogous to what we described above, a small forest can be construed in terms of a coalgebra structure
